WEBVTT

00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:02.756
WELL, YOU WANT
OLLIVANDERS.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.236
THERE AIN'T
NO PLACE BETTER.

00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:06.804
WHY DON'T YOU RUN
ALONG THERE AND WAIT?

00:00:06.847 --> 00:00:08.806
I JUST GOT ONE MORE
THING I GOT TO DO.

00:00:08.849 --> 00:00:10.155
WON'T BE LONG.

00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:15.813
[BELL JINGLING]

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:28.695
HELLO?

00:00:32.046 --> 00:00:33.396
HELLO?

00:00:34.962 --> 00:00:36.050
[GASPS]

00:00:37.748 --> 00:00:42.361
I WONDERED WHEN I'D BE
SEEING YOU, MR. POTTER.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.371
IT SEEMS ONLY YESTERDAY

00:00:52.415 --> 00:00:53.851
THAT YOUR
MOTHER AND FATHER

00:00:53.894 --> 00:00:57.463
WERE IN HERE BUYING
THEIR FIRST WANDS.

00:00:57.507 --> 00:00:58.725
AH.

00:01:04.688 --> 00:01:06.341
HERE WE ARE.

00:01:15.525 --> 00:01:17.440
WELL, GIVE IT A WAVE.

00:01:24.185 --> 00:01:26.449
APPARENTLY NOT.

00:01:30.714 --> 00:01:32.367
AHH.

00:01:34.631 --> 00:01:38.286
PERHAPS...

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:39.679
THIS.

00:01:47.295 --> 00:01:52.692
NO, NO. DEFINITELY NOT.
NO MATTER.

00:01:59.482 --> 00:02:01.527
I WONDER.

00:02:22.853 --> 00:02:24.898
[WHOOSH]

00:02:30.469 --> 00:02:32.819
CURIOUS.

00:02:32.863 --> 00:02:35.126
VERY CURIOUS.

00:02:36.127 --> 00:02:39.696
S-SORRY,
BUT WHAT'S CURIOUS?

00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:44.527
I REMEMBER EVERY WAND
I'VE EVER SOLD, MR. POTTER.

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:47.051
IT SO HAPPENS
THAT THE PHOENIX

00:02:47.094 --> 00:02:50.533
WHOSE TAIL FEATHER
RESIDES IN YOUR WAND

00:02:50.576 --> 00:02:52.535
GAVE ANOTHER FEATHER.

00:02:52.578 --> 00:02:55.755
JUST ONE OTHER.

00:02:55.799 --> 00:02:57.278
IT IS CURIOUS

00:02:57.322 --> 00:03:00.368
THAT YOU SHOULD BE
DESTINED FOR THIS WAND

00:03:00.412 --> 00:03:05.330
WHEN ITS BROTHER
GAVE YOU THAT SCAR.

00:03:07.637 --> 00:03:09.943
AND WHO OWNED THAT WAND?

00:03:09.987 --> 00:03:14.731
OH, WE DO NOT
SPEAK HIS NAME.

00:03:14.774 --> 00:03:18.604
THE WAND CHOOSES
THE WIZARD, MR. POTTER.

00:03:18.648 --> 00:03:21.912
IT'S NOT ALWAYS
CLEAR WHY,

00:03:21.955 --> 00:03:25.568
BUT I THINK IT IS CLEAR

00:03:25.611 --> 00:03:28.832
THAT WE CAN EXPECT
GREAT THINGS FROM YOU.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:34.446
AFTER ALL,
HE-WHO-MUST-NOT-BE-NAMED

00:03:34.489 --> 00:03:37.144
DID GREAT THINGS.

00:03:37.188 --> 00:03:41.366
TERRIBLE...YES,

00:03:41.409 --> 00:03:43.237
BUT GREAT.

00:03:47.633 --> 00:03:49.675
[RAPPING ON WINDOW]
HARRY! HARRY!
